https://github.com/databendlabs/databend/issues/20679  confirming

DROP DATABASE IF EXISTS repro_databend920_db3_min;
CREATE DATABASE repro_databend920_db3_min;
USE repro_databend920_db3_min;

SET enable_query_result_cache = 0;

CREATE TABLE s (
    id BIGINT NOT NULL,
    a DOUBLE NULL,
    b DOUBLE NOT NULL,
    g GEOMETRY NULL
) ENGINE = FUSE CLUSTER BY (id);

CREATE TABLE l (
    id BIGINT NOT NULL,
    a DOUBLE NULL
) ENGINE = FUSE CLUSTER BY (id);

CREATE TABLE r (
    id BIGINT NOT NULL,
    b DOUBLE NULL,
    g GEOMETRY NULL
) ENGINE = FUSE CLUSTER BY (id);

INSERT INTO s VALUES
    (1, 1.0,  1.0, ST_GEOMETRYFROMWKT('POINT(1 2)')),
    (2, NULL, 0.0, ST_GEOMETRYFROMWKT('POINT(0 0)'));

INSERT INTO l
SELECT id, a FROM s;

INSERT INTO r
SELECT id, b, g FROM s;

SELECT id, HEX(ST_ASWKB(g))
FROM s
WHERE b = a
ORDER BY id;

SELECT id, HEX(ST_ASWKB(g))
FROM (
    SELECT
        l.id,
        l.a,
        (SELECT r.b FROM r WHERE r.id = l.id) AS b,
        (SELECT r.g FROM r WHERE r.id = l.id) AS g
    FROM l
    WHERE l.id IN (
        SELECT id FROM r
    )
) x
WHERE b = a
ORDER BY id;

单表
1 | 0101000000000000000000f03f0000000000000040
多表
1 | 0101000000000000000000f03f0000000000000040
2 | 010100000000000000000000000000000000000000

单表把等值条件下推到 FUSE 扫描；多表把它并入标量子查询改写产生的 HashJoin 键。多表计划没有独立的 Filter，但不能说条件完全消失了。
单表：
TableScan(s)
  push downs: is_true(CAST(s.b AS Float64 NULL) = s.a)
→ EvalScalar → Sort
多表：
TableScan(l) + TableScan(r)
→ LEFT SEMI HashJoin          -- l.id IN (SELECT id FROM r)
→ INNER HashJoin              -- 键包含 l.a 与标量子查询得到的 r.b
→ RIGHT SINGLE HashJoin       -- 取相关标量子查询的 g
→ EvalScalar → Sort

a=NULL 的行仅在相关子查询返回 b=0.0 时被错误保留；改成 1.0 或 2.0 就不再出现。Databend 优化器在解关联相关标量子查询时，将 b = a 这个等值条件转换为 HashJoin 的键（key），但在这个过程中，它可能错误地处理了 a 列的 NULL 值。